      "text": [
        "The Pattern-weavers' craft. A harp strung to the open sky makes Pulse from the wind, for nothing. Because it is free, it is capped: up to **6 Pulse a second**.",
        "It holds **1,000 Pulse**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Where to hang it",
      "text": [
