        "- Under open sky: **2 a second** (1 base, 1 for the sky).",
        "- Height: **+1** at y 128 or higher, **+2** at y 192 or higher.",
        "- Weather: **+1** in rain, **+2** in a storm.",
        "That tops out at **6 a second** unranked. Ranking adds **15% Pulse a second** per rank."
