      "type": "text",
      "title": "Harps share the wind",
      "text": [
        "Harps within **12 blocks** of each other divide the wind between them, and the share rounds down: three crowded harps under a clear sky make nothing at all. A wall of harps is a wall of decorations. One harp is the point.",
        "A redstone signal pauses it. Crouch and right-click it with this book to see the sky, height, weather and crowd, and what each adds.",
        "Harps are the [Pattern-weavers'](tribe_clock) craft: the recipe needs a Storm Wing and an Air Seal, and the Pattern-weavers trade a harp to their Kin."
      ]
